# Brain Tumor Detection Models

This project includes two models for brain tumor detection and segmentation:
- **U-Net** for tumor segmentation.
- **CNN with Hybrid Convolution Layers** for tumor classification.

## Dataset Information

### U-Net Model
The dataset used for training the U-Net model is available on Kaggle:  
[**LGG MRI Segmentation Dataset**](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mateuszbuda/lgg-mri-segmentation)

### CNN Model
The CNN model is trained using the following dataset from Kaggle:  
[**Brain Tumor MRI Dataset**](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/masoudnickparvar/brain-tumor-mri-dataset)


